<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Infoseek cut to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Infoseek cut to buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex Brown said Tuesday it had cut its rating on Infoseek Corp to buy from strong buy.  </p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Infoseek shares were off 1/8 at 5-5/8.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
